/T (Learners who have a C1 level of English can comprehend a wide range of demanding and lengthy texts, including implicit meanings. Learners at this level can express themselves fluently and spontaneously with little hesitation. They can utilise the language with versatility and precision across various social, academic and professional settings. They can generate coherent, well-organised and elaborate texts on diverse topics, displaying accurate use of organisational structures, connectors and other elements to ensure cohesion.)
